{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_10_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_10","title":"铳响","storyCode":"PV-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"363b30ba6b32e294ca1d13b39d1d587b12be73c905f46936255f216c2e9fbc3f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，幼崽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一时间不知道翁贝托是看着自己被衰老和疾病吞噬更可怜，还是看着自己的幼崽一代比一代愚蠢更可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人类真是悲哀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"尽管印象已经非常模糊，但卢奇诺记得这个声音。\n是在老翁贝托牵着他从郊野的农庄回到德蒙塔诺的那个夜晚......\n他看着堆满了工具的操作台和一屋子的布料——这里以后就是他的家了。他感到无比陌生，只能呆呆地坐在椅子上。\n老翁贝托在外面和别人说话，隔着窗户，他突然转过头来，似乎在把自己指给谁看，但卢奇诺没有看见他对面的是谁。\n那是他的爷爷，他唯一的亲人，卢奇诺感到无比紧张。\n然后，卢奇诺听见了一个声音有些愤怒又无奈地说：“故技重施，人类真是无耻！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是爷爷的......朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友、师生、主仆、雇主与受托人......我已经无从界定我与翁贝托的关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这片荒野的主人，幼崽，你的爷爷是我的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他的表现实在是太过差劲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来是真的老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前在操作台边待再久，也不会觉得夜晚有这么漫长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不会连你是什么时候进来的都不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"十分钟前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，你介意我一边工作一边说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚有位意想不到的老朋友突然到访，耽误了些时间。这套套装，最关键的几道裁剪和拼接工序，我得抓紧做完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于最后的收尾，卢奇诺那孩子自己应该也能摸索着完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红没有在你身上闻到哪怕一丝狼味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你也没有使用特殊的手段来隐藏。红刚刚观察过，红能够分辨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是最后的真狼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“真狼”......唔，你是说獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有找错人，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我观察了翁贝托许久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着他上门为形形色色的人服务，在量体时突然将特制的剪刀送进某些人的喉咙，对方甚至连血都很少出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他并不像英格丽那样能打，但很聪明，懂得如何利用自己的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也善于隐藏，更多的时间都待在那家叫德蒙塔诺的店里，作为杀手和作为裁缝的生意都很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我选中了他，我告诉了他狼之主与游戏的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷的故事竟然都是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是故事里的狼......难怪他会想要脱离家族，作为被狼之主选中的人类，作为叙拉古最特别的裁缝，他当然拥有那份清醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷答应了你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有獠牙能够拒绝狼之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但翁贝托提出了一个条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"条、条件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫长的岁月里，他并非第一个试图和狼之主讲条件的獠牙。狂妄的人类，我有一百种方法毁灭他们，再去物色新的人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷他想要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托希望在为我赢得胜利之前，能够先将自己的幼崽抚养成人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说他的妻子已经病亡，名为卢卡的幼崽年纪尚小，如果脱离了他，可能无法生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是这样。所以我答应了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人类社会不比荒野那般凶险，养育一个幼崽而已，我彼时没有想过这会耗去他如此多的时间和精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会定期去那间裁缝店看看，确保他没有对我欺瞒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后，翁贝托停下了他的杀手业务，他所有的时间都投在了缝纫机、布料和那个日渐长大的幼崽身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他挥动剪刀的手依旧稳健，眼神依旧锐利，所以我愿意遵守承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要的是一支不会折断的獠牙，而非随时会因分心被咬断喉咙的牺牲品。我可以给他时间，我有的是时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是爸爸他最终......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稀里糊涂地死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁贝托有些失魂落魄，我给了他足够的时间平复心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然和翁贝托本来的计划有些出入，但总归他没有了牵挂。所以某个夜晚，我再次找上了他，要求他兑现承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的獠牙，竟然再次提出了一个条件——"},{"type":"narration","text":"狼之主突然停了下来，注视着眼前的小裁缝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他意外得知自己的幼崽竟然留下了血脉，他在世间还有唯一的亲人......他希望在开始狩猎之前，将你抚养成人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“故技重施，人类真是无耻！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那天晚上听到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次我并未同意，但他似乎忘记了自己卑贱的身份，忘记了我与他的关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次找到他，他都是絮叨着什么人生的很多情节像是重来了一遍，却还恬不知耻地说不会赖掉对我的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是从我记事起，爷爷的身体就已经不太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为獠牙，别说为我赢取胜利，他甚至已经无法解决自己的那些麻烦，这样的他连自保都困难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫长的时间里，我等待他抽身，却只等来了他的衰老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实爷爷他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道他真正在乎的从来都只有他的德蒙塔诺，他的那些套装，和自己身边的那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他才愿意去做那些他本来做不到的事情......翁贝托就是这样愚蠢的人类，我错看了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主，你为什么要告诉我这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不仅白忙活了一场，还因此破坏了游戏的规矩，接下来需要忍受狼群无尽的嘲弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是他的幼崽，你必须接受惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惩、惩罚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要销毁那些武器，还是炸毁这艘船？无论你今晚想做什么，都不会成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的胸前......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢奇诺低头看向胸前，外套的衣襟敞开着，皱巴巴的，扣子应该是刚刚在混乱中不小心弄掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幼崽，无论你想成为何种人物，在做那些事之前，先缝好自己的扣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，滚回翁贝托身边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢奇诺","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的演技很烂，瓦古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故意装作疾言厉色......你不想我们伤害那个幼崽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他本就与我们的游戏无关——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古，你忘了刚刚狼群的决议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在本轮游戏结束之前，所有狼之主必须好好待在甲板上，不得插手任何事情。否则......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经输了，恺撒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"银色的狼之主突然抬起了头。\n他看向城市的某个方向，狂欢的喧嚣响彻城市，夜空亮如白昼，没人会注意到一朵云在此时消散。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，风送来了熟悉的气味。红已经得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不会像扎罗那样耍无赖，恺撒。我违反了狼群的决议，无论什么惩罚，我都接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恺撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在为獠牙难过？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":"avg_npc_1548_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是失败的滋味有些苦涩罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有外婆帮助，红找不到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“外婆”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如此称呼自己的狼主？我还以为他们都只会凶巴巴地说话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过真说起来，瓦古其实早就发现了我在骗他吧......唉，真是个嘴硬心软的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不打算反抗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“也”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红杀死上一个真狼时，她完全没有反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是捂着那只瘸腿，看着红的刀扎穿自己的胸膛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红听到她叹气，嘀咕着“提心吊胆的日子终于结束了”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来，死对她来说是一种解脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你的身手，我不会有举起刀的机会吧......更何况，我也愿意多和你说会儿话。真要动起手来，我手头这套新套装可就毁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"量体、裁剪、拼贴、塑形......四块布料，最终变成笔挺的衣服和裤子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一套标准的叙拉古套装，有足足四百五十多道工序，但静下心来一道一道做完，其实很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"缝纫机的声音终于停了。\n老裁缝认真剪去了所有多余的线头，起身，从猎狼人的身边经过，将那套崭新的套装挂在了墙上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他长舒了一口气，揉揉发胀的眼睛，慢慢地走到角落的沙发上躺下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"介意我躺会儿吗？年纪大了，工作的时间一长就头晕眼花的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆说得没错，真狼善于伪装。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不理解为什么你的身上没有丝毫狼味，但这掩盖不了你们对外婆做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"你们吞吃了外婆的眼睛、手臂和心脏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"回答红，真狼，你们为什么要进行如此残忍的游戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，这是你认知中游戏的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题，你应该也问过上一个死在你手里的獠牙吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，我同样没法回答你，我们都是被命运稀里糊涂找上的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，无论陪伴我们的是真相还是谎言，凡事都会走向一个结局......到那时候，你会做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"去找另外一只真狼，她从红的手下逃脱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她的弓箭力道很弱，不是红的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。我是问，杀死所有的“真狼”后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏结束，外婆得救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......你呢，到那时，你要去哪里，你会做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，这么长的时间，你一直在寻找真狼、猎杀真狼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（晃耳朵）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不是。红一直在帮着凯尔希，罗德岛上有很多事情需要红去做......"},{"type":"narration","text":"猎狼人低下了头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红已经浪费了很多时间。"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒光在红的衣袖里闪现，那是匕首，红一直将它握在手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"真狼，你不害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，当然不是。哪怕没有你，我也会害怕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从很久前，我的身体就一天不如一天了。当你明确知道自己命不久矣时，还是会害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我起码没有像你口中的那个人一样，在漫长的时间里只能活着等死......那可比死亡本身要可怕多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想了想，我这辈子其实没有做成什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个稀里糊涂背了一身血债的杀手，一个看着孩子死去的爸爸，一个不知道该怎么管教孙子的爷爷，一个甚至没有入局的獠牙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我起码算是一个好裁缝，一个幸运的老家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有多少人能在临死的时候手头还做着那件自己做了一辈子的活计呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁贝托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢奇诺，收尾的工作就交给你了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"红没有举起匕首，因为已经不需要了。\n沙发上的老人没有了鼻息，仿佛刚刚完成那身衣服抽空了他所有的力气。\n红盯着老人的脸，目不转睛。\n她见过很多死人，他们临死前的表情都像是戴上了面具。\n哪怕是那只等死的瘸腿真狼，在看见她闯入时也露出过惊恐的表情，直到临终那刻才终于释然。\n至于龙门废墟里的那些整合运动成员，还有试图侵入罗德岛的歹徒，他们死时或咒骂或恐惧，表情总是扭曲的。\n可从她进入德蒙塔诺到现在，眼前的老人始终是这样的神情，他没有伪装，红终于可以确定。\n他真的是外婆说的那样子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"真狼死在了猎狼人面前，但猎狼人没有来得及出手。\n红的心里满是疑惑。\n“到那时，你要去哪里，你会做什么？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，红不明白......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g10_landshipdeck"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>巡游队伍到达法院广场，倒计时十五分钟</><p=2>1100年11月9日    11:30 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......拉普兰德，看起来你比我更讨厌叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你是觉得我做这一切，是在报复什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经和自己的过去道别了，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没办什么像样的仪式，但一点都不妨碍它的郑重哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是没有给你讲过，我是怎么改行当起了出租车司机的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和扎罗在荒野上捡到了那辆险些报废的出租车——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们俩混到了一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢这么直接打断我说话的人不多，不愧是德克萨斯——是的，他现在是我的跟班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几个叙拉古人结伴来新沃尔西尼，却莫名其妙在荒野上大打出手，最后那辆车被送到了我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是叙拉古向我发出了邀请，德克萨斯。我就这么来到了这里，就像你去年不得不回到沃尔西尼一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真不是你从什么深夜电台里听来的节目吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是不介意把这个故事送给电台，或者电影公司，感觉能拍一部不错的公路片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，一年前，我也坐在了灰厅那张破圆桌前，陪着你们一起，从西西里那个老太婆手里要来了这座崭新的移动城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"满怀着理想的青年才俊们要一展抱负，创造一个截然不同的叙拉古，我也算投了原始股，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，新沃尔西尼已经建成一周年，成为了这个国家最特别的存在，我当然要回到这里，和大家一起庆祝嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了让狂欢节能够顺利进行，我可是悄悄帮着解决了不少麻烦呢，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指的是把武器乱洒在广场上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，当然不止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如我那亲爱的父亲，他对这座新城市可是有不少非分之想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔贝托不是已经被暂时拘留了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我们家待过那么长的时间，应该很清楚萨卢佐的家主是个怎样的坏种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕经历了沃尔西尼的失败，哪怕新沃尔西尼的市政厅和法院对他再严防死守，他也不会允许任何事情脱离自己的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让一些事情脱离了他的控制，仅此而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很快就会知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德，你真的不是为了报复吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你当然也可以这么解读。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有广场上这些戴着面具的家伙，我们之前在法庭上见过他们的老大，那个谈笑风生的佩洛，你还有印象吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小威尼斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越鄙弃游戏的人，把游戏规则吃得越透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和他的威尼斯载具公司可从未违反过《新都市管理法案》，他本人甚至两次获得“杰出青年企业家”荣誉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，他可能比咱俩更讨厌叙拉古，但他也比绝大多数的狼更懂得如何应对天气的变化，如何在泥潭里打滚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的发型真的梳得太油腻了，我很讨厌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比之下，我还是更喜欢和狼没那么像的沃尔珀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，一位沃尔珀母亲千里迢迢回到叙拉古，想要为自己意外感染了矿石病的女儿讨回公道......是不是很令人感动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，我还恰好认识那位母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮她找到了凶手，只是一件力所能及的小事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换作是你，肯定也会帮一把的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听起来，市政厅应该也给你颁个奖，“见义勇为好市民”之类的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在今夜怎么样，而你正好可以当我的颁奖嘉宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，受之有愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟就算我跑来跑去耽误了不少生意，事情还是发展成了现在这个样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们回到赌约本身吧，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看广场上那两群焦灼的狼......时间已经越来越近了，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>巡游队伍到达法院广场，倒计时十分钟</><p=2>1100年11月9日    11:35 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......英格丽，有你一起，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐家的白狼打乱了我们的布置，我正要前往港口处理突发情况，不然威尼斯在新沃尔西尼的所有积累都会毁于一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经归还了家徽，家里的事情已与我无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再装下去就没意思了，安东尼奥，你知道我为什么出现在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从什么时候开始怀疑丽萨受伤的事情与我有关的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你告诉我你知道真相开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过真正让我得以确认的，是你刚才的反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是看到我出现，你就认定那个西西里人背叛了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，英格丽，你对我“使诈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非没有过怀疑，安东尼奥。比如当年唐克雷蒂家族的人就算要刺杀威尼斯的家主，选择通过一个孩子来下手变数未免太多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如他们的计划再怎么周详，也不至于能提前准备好丽萨半个月前偶然看电影才喜欢上的玩偶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场刺杀根本就不存在，你一开始的目的便只是利用丽萨的受伤逼我自乱阵脚，将我赶出家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将丽萨带回家里后，吃穿住用都是你在尽心尽力安排，那孩子曾经不止一次说你是“很会照顾人的佩洛舅舅”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有来到新沃尔西尼的这段时间，你几次三番说的那些请求我回家的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你脸上的面具太过逼真，安东尼奥，它让你的演技浑然天成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，这所有的一切都是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽萨，我爱那个可爱又聪明的孩子，她愿意叫我舅舅的时候，我由衷地开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在当时，你挡在了我的路上，英格丽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你在家里，我便永远不会有出头之日，更不可能走到今天的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯与唐克雷蒂的斗争已经到了无所不用其极的地步，发生什么都不稀奇，我不会错过那样的机会——而丽萨是你唯一的软肋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于为什么将你赶出家族又邀请你回来，那就更好理解了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时过境迁了，英格丽。无论在家族内部，还是在新沃尔西尼，如今的“小威尼斯”身边正好缺那么一个得力助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至做好了准备，以威尼斯载具公司的名义去资助那家叫罗德岛的医药公司，好让他们能尽全力医治丽萨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼奥，老爷收留了你我，我们一起在威尼斯家族生活了十几年，你却依然能这么毫无心理负担地伤害最亲近的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，英格丽，你又想说我无视了家族的“体面”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实一直很好奇，你是真心认同爸爸的这套说辞，还是故作糊涂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们总是在煞有介事地强调“体面”，好让我们看起来多么有原则，多么有情有爱，和其他家族有多么不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们明明也只是一群手上沾满了血的混蛋，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫翁贝托的裁缝，早年欠了爸爸一点恩情，就那样成为了他的傀儡，帮他杀人，做一件又一件脏活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果家族真的体面，他为什么要摆脱家族，一门心思做他的套装？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你脸上的这道伤疤，对你来说它是荣誉还是耻辱？它其实等于家族扩张过程中的多少条人命，英格丽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在叙拉古，在这座肮脏的泥潭里，有谁真的是体面人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起码在我们这群人中间，没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，这个距离，出刀很方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真是坦荡啊，安东尼奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格丽，我只是认为，你我不应该期待在对方身上看到一些不切实际的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古人更应该做的，是随时做好失去一切，包括自己至亲之人的准备。这也是我曾经最欣赏你的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"光芒乍盛。\n两人所在的巷子与法院广场隔着一面高墙，只有几盏昏暗的路灯亮着。这里并不存在特别的光源，突然的强光让英格丽一瞬间陷入目眩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......你的源石技艺？藏得够好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是发出一瞬间的强光......没什么用，甚至看起来有些可笑，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我这辈子第二次使用它。当年，我跪在雨林的泥地里，没有这道光，我就躲不过那颗子弹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更没办法挟持那个随手将我们从赦免名单上勾去的醉鬼贵族，最后割下他的脑袋，逃出生天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用刚刚那一通慷慨激昂的发言激起我的愤怒，让我分神，再用强光创造机会——你从看见我的瞬间，就计划好了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是英格丽，我只刺中了你腰间的御守......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼奥，从我知道你到底是个怎样的人开始，你便不会再有任何机会得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说来可笑。我来的路上甚至在想，不是不能留你一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"丽萨的病确实不可治愈，但她现在在罗德岛遇到了志同道合的朋友，她甚至主动成为了他们的干员，为其他的矿石病患者奔走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此前我一直在忧愁丽萨的教育问题，但阴差阳错地，她的人生也算有了另一番际遇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！英格丽·威尼斯！直到现在，你还要用所谓的“体面”羞辱我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以你的刀法，不应该偏开心脏一寸，咳咳——我现在不应该还能说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站在你面前的只是英格丽，一个母亲，而你刚刚已经成功激起了她的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"非要说体面的话......只是不想你死得太体面而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"留你一口气，你会一点点失血至死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼奥，那是你应该感受的，痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一朵烟花在不远处的天空绽放，照亮了英格丽的脸。这意味着巡游的队伍即将抵达广场，狂欢节即将迎来高潮。\n大概要很久，人们才会发现一墙之隔的地方躺着一个佩洛吧，英格丽想到这里，忍不住嗤笑了一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格丽","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她跨过了地上的人，就这么离开了小巷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>巡游队伍到达法院广场，倒计时四分钟</><p=2>1100年11月9日    11:41 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，安东尼奥还是联系不上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭呢？这家伙怎么也没影了，关键时刻掉链子......西西里人果然靠不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么好怎么办的，这又不是拍电影，拍得不好就收工去吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的布置都已经暴露，在市政厅眼里，我们已经露出了真面目。哪怕现在收手，我们还能重新变回“新沃尔西尼人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成安东尼奥交代的任务，拿下法院，再与港口取得联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶来增援的人都拿到武器了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，收到我的命令就动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉大家伙，虽然有的人已经快一年没摸过武器了，但可别比对面这些臭开车的手生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有结果了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是我们想要的那个决定，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g14_governmentoffice_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你告诉伊雷妮，对索默尔的死，我很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这份判决书，给再多的时间考虑，我也不能签署。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃尔西尼绝不会容忍家族的恶行，但这并不意味着其他人就可以趁机达成自己的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一年，我持续收到一些朋友的来信，他们有的在其他城市当着法官或者律师，有的早已改了行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在信里向我提了很多建议，关于《新都市管理法案》的法理依据，以及有哪些具体的条文值得改进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我能在字里行间读出他们的很多情绪，担忧、困惑、期待，甚至是羡慕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《新都市管理法案》在叙拉古是特殊的。它是这座城市存在的依凭，许多人都在关注它，也有更多人为它的出现付出过牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承认它有时候还是很无力，但越是这样，越是这种时候，我越不能让它变成一纸空文，甚至是被人利用的工具......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅还是那个拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，伊雷妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i14_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"集中精神，听我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这群人拿到了武器，他们已经变回了真正的狼......局面彻底失控了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我小时候来叙拉古的时候，就见识过这些家族成员的手段，他们在半个小时内就血洗了我舅舅一家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一会儿，会有烟雾干扰他们的视线，你下令让大家逃。暗号，手势，我知道你有法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没有尝试过一下子施放如此大范围的烟雾，我不确定效果会怎么样，自己又能撑多久，所以要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡车就在我们身后，撤进驾驶室，离开广场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，我没能守在索默尔身边，他的死我有责任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这个倒霉蛋能做的不多，但我不能让这些兄弟姐妹都稀里糊涂地死在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那是铳，不是扳手！别对着我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也别对着你自己啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我、我根本不会用这些东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"彼得罗，那就对准前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i14_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可前面不也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别担心走火，也别担心误触施术单元的什么开关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚已经和拉维妮娅法官沟通过了，按照《新都市管理法案》，这些家族成员已经被判决为极端犯罪者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算真的误伤到了那些人，大家也不会被追究责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，拿稳手里的武器。我们是在保护拉维妮娅大法官，保护法院，也保护我们自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，明明......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欢呼声，很近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再过几分钟，浩浩荡荡的巡游队伍就会到达法院广场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全城的民众会如何理解他们看到的景象？真正下达判决结果的，是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法律讲究事实，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮的声音在颤抖，她显然也很紧张，但她握着弩箭的手很稳。柳德米拉看着她，没来由地，她突然觉得对方有些陌生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moon"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moonmasked"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i19"},{"type":"narration","text":"戴着野兽面具的人群与卡车司机们分成了两个阵营，像是两条泾渭分明的河流。\n地面上只剩下被砸碎的箱子，武器落在了每一个人的手里。\n......每一个人都听见了不远处的喧天声响。\n巨型花车驶过地面的闷声、乐团的即兴演奏、杂耍艺人的吆喝......狂欢的队伍正在向这里靠近。\n然后，细碎但更清晰的动静在他们身边响起。那是铳在上膛，施术单元在启动，弩箭在解除保险......\n没有地方可以躲避，没有地方可以后退。\n还没有人动手，但只差一声铳响，两条泾渭分明的河流便会决堤，狂潮将淹没一切。\n......\n没有一个人说话，所有人的神经都绷紧到了极点。所有人都在听着那些声音，和自己不受控制的心跳。\n明明很快新沃尔西尼就将走入新的一天。\n但夜如此漫长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]}]}
